# ==============================================================================
# Trivy Vulnerability Suppression List (.trivyignore)
# ==============================================================================
# Syntax:
#   <Vulnerability-ID>
#
# Examples:
#   CVE-2023-12345
#   GHSA-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx
#
# Suppression Guidelines:
# 1. Always document the vulnerability identifier, date added, and reason/justification.
# 2. Prefer fixing, patching, or upgrading packages over ignoring vulnerabilities.
# 3. If a vulnerability is unfixed upstream and non-exploitable in the application runtime,
#    state the mitigated vector and expiration date for review.
#
# Example suppression with comment:
# # Ignored on 2026-11-10: Vulnerability only impacts unused CLI tool, runtime unaffected.
# # Review by: 2026-12-31
# # CVE-2023-99999
